  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2802.03 Error of law",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2802.03 “Error of law” means the incorrect application of any relevant law or rule to the administrative license suspension review or hearing specified by RSA 265-A:31.\n\nSource. #8782-A, eff 1-1-07 (formerly Saf-C 2801.021); ss by #10888, eff 7-16-15",
